    "name": "Coin x Union",
    "steam_appid": 3585030,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coin pusher x Watermelon-like game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game where you can enjoy Coin pusher and Watermelon-like union action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy this crossover between the coin pusher element of dropping and collecting coins and the exhilarating Watermelon-like sensation of uniting coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throw a coin and let's union coins!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you hit the same coins together (union), they will turn into higher-ranked coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for the golden coin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, if you union coins, bonus coins will fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try to get the coins without dropping them!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the boxes to grab the coins that fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you drop them towards you, black coins that cannot be unionized will fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to grab them without dropping them if possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim for a high score!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect high-scoring coins through union or get and aim for a high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will finish when the number of coins falls below the value of the coins you threw, or when they fly off to the left, right, or back of the platform and fall.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coin pusher x Watermelon-like game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game where you can enjoy Coin pusher and Watermelon-like union action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy this crossover between the coin pusher element of dropping and collecting coins and the exhilarating Watermelon-like sensation of uniting coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throw a coin and let's union coins!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you hit the same coins together (union), they will turn into higher-ranked coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for the golden coin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, if you union coins, bonus coins will fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try to get the coins without dropping them!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the boxes to grab the coins that fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you drop them towards you, black coins that cannot be unionized will fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to grab them without dropping them if possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim for a high score!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect high-scoring coins through union or get and aim for a high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will finish when the number of coins falls below the value of the coins you threw, or when they fly off to the left, right, or back of the platform and fall.</p>",
